<title>INDIA: India's RBI says cut-off unchanged at 3.60 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI says cut-off unchanged at 3.60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off rate of 3.60 percent at a four-day repo auction on Monday, unchanged from the previous week.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received and accepted 17 bids for 62.50 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 3.5148 percent.</p>
</text>
